gbtui
=====

A terminal UI runtime and widget library extracted from Grok Build's TUI.

This product includes original work and portions derived from Grok Build:

  crates/codegen/xai-ratatui-inline
  crates/codegen/xai-ratatui-textarea
  crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager-render
  crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager  (selected views / input / runtime primitives only)
  crates/codegen/xai-grok-markdown
  crates/codegen/xai-grok-markdown-core

